        <h2>Pond water goes bad quietly, then all at once.</h2>
        <p>Fish farming and hatchery management depend on stable pH, temperature, turbidity and oxygen — but the tools most ponds rely on haven't kept up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-grid reveal reveal-stagger">
