          <h3>Fish mortality</h3>
          <p>Sudden pH swings, low oxygen or dirty water can kill stock within hours of the first warning sign.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card glass" style="--i:2">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <div class="picon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 17c3-8 6-8 9 0M12 17c3-8 6-8 9 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Water quality fluctuations</h3>
          <p>Temperature, pH and turbidity drift constantly with weather, feeding and stocking density — and rarely at convenient hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem-card glass" style="--i:3">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <div class="picon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M3 20c0-3.5 2.5-6 6-6s6 2.5 6 6M15 8a3 3 0 1 1 4 2.8M21 20c0-2.8-1.8-5-4.5-5.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Labour dependency &amp; scale</h3>
